/* Welcome */
"Show Welcome…" = "Mostrar bienvenida…";
"Welcome to Clipline" = "Te damos la bienvenida a Clipline";
"Out of sight, within reach" = "Fuera de la vista, a tu alcance";
"Its own screenshot tool" = "Su propia herramienta de capturas";
"A gesture for everything" = "Un gesto para cada cosa";
"Snip to clear" = "Corta para despejar";
"You’re all set" = "Todo listo";
"Every screenshot you take hangs on a line at the top of the screen, ready to copy, mark up or drag where it needs to go." = "Cada captura que hagas se cuelga en una cuerda en la parte superior de la pantalla, lista para copiarla, marcarla o arrastrarla adonde haga falta.";
"Rest the pointer in the middle of the menu bar and the line slides down. Move away and it tucks back up." = "Deja el puntero en el centro de la barra de menús y la cuerda baja. Aléjalo y vuelve a esconderse.";
"The screen holds still. Click a window to take it, or drag out an area. Press Return and it hangs on the line." = "La pantalla se congela. Haz clic en una ventana para capturarla o arrastra un área. Pulsa Retorno y se cuelga en la cuerda.";
"Click a photo to copy it. Press and hold to mark it up. Drag it into an app to send it, or into a folder to keep it." = "Haz clic en una foto para copiarla. Mantenla pulsada para marcarla. Arrástrala a una app para enviarla o a una carpeta para guardarla.";
"Hold the rope beside the clips and sweep sideways: every photo the scissors pass falls. Undo hangs them back." = "Mantén pulsada la cuerda junto a las pinzas y desliza de lado: cae cada foto por la que pasan las tijeras. Deshacer las vuelve a colgar.";
"Clipline lives in the menu bar. Its menu holds every setting, and this welcome if you want to see it again." = "Clipline vive en la barra de menús. Su menú tiene todos los ajustes, y esta bienvenida si quieres volver a verla.";
"Show or hide the line" = "Mostrar u ocultar la cuerda";
"Your screenshot settings come back when you turn it off or quit Clipline." = "Tus ajustes de captura vuelven cuando lo desactivas o sales de Clipline.";
"Skip" = "Omitir";
"Back" = "Atrás";
"Continue" = "Continuar";
"Get Started" = "Empezar";
"Click to copy" = "Clic para copiar";
"Press and hold to mark up" = "Mantén pulsado para marcar";
"Drag into a folder to keep it" = "Arrastra a una carpeta para guardarla";

